      "correctAnswer": "24",
      "explanation": "Let Marcus's rate be r. Sofia's is 2r, so together (3)r = 1/16, giving r = 1/48. Sofia's rate 2r = 2/48 = 1/24, so Sofia alone takes 24 hours.",
      "questionNumber": 9
    },
    {
